      "note": "The authored key stands.  The stem asks for the TWO sentences that show WHY the water subsystem and the food modules are cleared, and the blind read returned only one of them.  Span 0 gives the measurement that clears them, water reclamation holding near ninety-five percent and every meal covered, and span 2 gives the reason that measurement is decisive, which is that dust on a clear panel cannot reach a job that never depended on light.  Dropping span 2 leaves the evidence without its mechanism, which is exactly the distinction this item is built to teach.  Neither span was touched by the 26-0822 prose pass;  the item was re-answered only because its hash follows the passage, and it read agree on the identical key before that pass.",
